# Desktop UI

Follow [desktop/DESIGN.md](desktop/DESIGN.md).

## Must

- Palette: near-black void + honey yellow `#F5B800`. Logo is black/yellow only.
- Primary buttons: honey fill, black label, amber glow + inset depth.
- Secondary/ghost: black glass, honey hairline.
- Surfaces: liquid glass (`backdrop-filter`) with deep shadow + inset highlight.
- Logo file: `desktop/public/logo.svg` (replace with final mark; keep hex-readable).

## Must not

- French blue / purple / soft-sky SaaS kits.
- Spreading yellow onto every border and icon — reserve honey for CTAs, active, focus, brand.
- Cartoon bee stickers or emoji storms.
